'''Bird of light beacon''' is a light-type spell used to create a flying bird of light.{{Ref|m|11}}

==Description==
Bird of light beacon contains a central light sigil with a dispersion sign on one side, a launch sign on the opposite side, and 2 bird sigils on the other two. The spell produces a bird made from light that will fly around for some time, and can be used to either entertain, call for help, or distract.{{Ref|m|11}}

==Usage==
During the rescue at the river, [[Agott]] used this  spell to distract the [[outsider]] in the area so [[Coco]] could perform magic to save [[Custas]] without being seen, as well as to call for help.{{Ref|m|11}}

